@SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7221
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar (filtros opcionales: search, isActive)
GET {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=camiseta&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

### Obtener por Id
GET {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "TSHIRT-001",
  "name": "Camiseta básica",
  "description": "Algodón 100%",
  "price": 19.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stock": 50
}

### Editar (el SKU no se modifica)
PUT {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Camiseta básica premium",
  "description": "Algodón orgánico",
  "price": 24.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stock": 40
}

### Desactivar
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/deactivate

### Activar
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/activate

### Eliminar
DELETE {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### ───────── Sucursales ─────────
@branchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar sucursales (filtros opcionales: search, isActive)
GET {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches?isActive=true
Accept: application/json

### Obtener sucursal por Id
GET {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches/{{branchId}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear sucursal (debe ofrecer retiro, envío o ambos)
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NORTE",
  "name": "Sucursal Norte",
  "address": "Av. Principal 123, Zona Norte",
  "phone": "+1 555 0100",
  "allowsPickup": true,
  "allowsDelivery": true
}

### Editar sucursal (el código no se modifica)
PUT {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches/{{branchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sucursal Norte",
  "address": "Av. Principal 456, Zona Norte",
  "phone": null,
  "allowsPickup": true,
  "allowsDelivery": false
}

### Desactivar sucursal
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches/{{branchId}}/deactivate

### Activar sucursal
POST {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches/{{branchId}}/activate

### Eliminar sucursal
DELETE {{SimpleEcom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches/{{branchId}}
